MARKET DATA

Historical prices are retrieved at runtime from Yahoo Finance's public chart
endpoint. That data is not redistributed with this project and remains subject
to Yahoo's terms of use. Users are responsible for their own compliance.

The bundled share-count table (internal/market/assets/shares_outstanding.csv)
is compiled from the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission's XBRL
"company facts" API. SEC EDGAR filings are works of the United States
government and are not subject to copyright. Each row cites the accession
number of the filing it came from. See the header of that file for its
accuracy caveats.

The bundled index-membership table (internal/market/assets/sp500_membership.csv)
is a derived database reconstructed from the "List of S&P 500 companies"
article on the English Wikipedia, including its recorded list of index
changes:

    https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_S%26P_500_companies

That article is licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0
International License (CC BY-SA 4.0):

    https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/

The table in this repository is a derivative of it and is made available under
the same CC BY-SA 4.0 terms, separately from the MIT licence that covers the
source code. Regenerate it with `pyrite ingest index`.

"S&P 500" is a registered trademark of S&P Dow Jones Indices LLC. This project
is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by S&P Dow Jones Indices, and
uses the name only to describe what the data refers to.
